  <Callout kind="remember">
    A survivor falls exactly as many cells as there were winners below it,
    and a survivor with none below it is never touched, because the drop-in
    only builds jobs for cells with a non-zero distance. Give the engine the
    winners your rules found, not a grid diff, and give it the next grid
    with the new symbols at the entry end; it animates what it is given.
  </Callout>
